10960000346._kDes:
【Quick Cast】PC Mode only. Press the button to cast the skill immediately at the mouse cursor;
【Standard Cast】PC Mode only. Press the button to display an indicator that follows the mouse cursor, then click the left mouse button again to cast;
【Smart Cast】Press the skill to cast it on the Selected Target without using the mouse.

10960000348._kDes:
【Self Position】Casts at your feet;
【Farthest Point Toward Nearest Unit】Casts at maximum range in the direction of the nearest unit;
【Farthest Point Ahead】Casts at maximum range in the direction you are facing.

10960000349._kDes:
【Hard Lock】Once you select a target, you will chase that target. Recommended for players confident in their controls who want complete control over their attack target;
【Semi-Soft Lock】Switches targets when the current target exceeds a certain range, which can be adjusted under 【Chase Distance】. Recommended for players who know their Job well and have a strong sense of Distance;
【Full Soft Lock】Only attacks targets within attack range. Recommended for players who want to cast skills quickly and efficiently.

10960000351._kDes:
【Nearest】Prioritizes nearby targets. Recommended for close-range Jobs that fight on the front line;
【Low HP】Prioritizes targets with low HP. Recommended for players looking to secure more kills;
【Smart DPS】The System selects the optimal target. Recommended for players who prefer automatic target selection;
【Smart Healing】Selects only party Members as targets. Recommended for players using healing Jobs.

